| Fastener | Size | Class | Torque (Nm) | Lubrication |
|----------|------|-------|-------------|--------------|
| Battery M12 inserts | M12×1.75 | 10.9 | 80 ±5 | Dry |
| Node M8 bolts | M8×1.25 | 8.8 | 25 ±3 | Light oil |
| Suspension bolts (M12) | M12×1.25 | 10.9 | 90 ±5 | Anti‑seize |
| Wheel lug nuts | M12×1.5 | 10.9 | 110 ±10 | Dry |
| Crash can bolts | M12×1.75 | 10.9 | 80 ±5 | Dry |
| Rivets (blind) | 6.4 mm | Steel | N/A | Pull until stem breaks |

All torque values are for clean, dry threads unless noted.

